 be a tooltip to explain why, e.g: `This Resource is already unique.`\r\n- If you save a resource to disk, **Make Unique** is still grayed out in the dropdown, even though you can left-click the file icon to make the resource built-in.\r\n  - This is bound to create a lot of support questions related to the feature not being accessible anymore, so I suggest making **Make Unique** still available in this scenario (perhaps rename it to **Make Built-In** in this case).\r\n\r\n<img width=\"276\" height=\"820\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe9e6987-3824-419a-9a9c-feffed14f4f7\" />\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109458#pullrequestreview-3291278677","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109458","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-01T21:56:38Z"},{"id":3346644972,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Heb_s","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109458#pullrequestreview-3346644972","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109458","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-10-16T20:32:15Z"},{"id":3347180160,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7HgeqA","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124409014?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/San